  "verseCount": 59,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amachiiko igoro y’oborwaire bwa ukoma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa na Aroni, akabateebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero omonto abeire negesambo, gose abimbire risankwa ri’omobere oye, gose risankwa riatorekire na koonchoka ribe buna oborwaire bwa ukoma, omonto oyio arentwe ase Aroni Omokuani, gose ase oyomo bw’abamura baye ore Omokuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani oyio areenge oborwaire obwo buya. Kararore ng’a amarionya are ase egesambo keria aonchokire abeire amarabu, na oborwaire bwakorire engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, rirorio oborwaire obwo nobwa ukoma. Ekero Omokuani arengire omonto oria buya, ateebe ng’a oyio onyorekanire ng’a tachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye egesambo keria kere ekerabu, korende tigekoreti engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, na amarionya egesambo keria tabeti amarabu, rirorio Omokuani abeeke omonto oria ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere Omokuani amorenge naende, na kararore ng’a oborwaire boria tibwesiarereti ase risankwa, erio amobeeke naende ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko ande atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere amorenge naende, na kararore ng’a egesambo keria giachakire gosira, na oborwaire boria tibwesiarereti ase risankwa erio Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oria ochenekire, namaote oka abwate. Omonto oria asibie chianga chiaye, erio abe oyochenegete kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende egesambo keria gokeraabe giesiareire ase risankwa magega Omokuani karorire ng’a ochenekire, omonto oria goika airane ase Omokuani naende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ere kararore ng’a egesambo keria giesiareire ase risankwa, erio ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti. Obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero omonto abwate oborwaire bwa ukoma araarentwe ase Omokuani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ere amorenge buya. Kararore egesambo ekerabu ase risankwa, na amarionya aonchokire abeire amarabu, naende onye enyama embariri yachakire gokina imeo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma obokoro bogendererete ase engaki entambe ase risankwa ri’omobere bw’omonto oria. Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti; bono tamobeeka ase egesomo, ekiagera tachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye oborwaire obwo bwa ukoma bwasokire ase risankwa isiko, na Omokuani ororire ng’a bwesiareire ase omobere bwonsi korwa omotwe goika amagoro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erio Omokuani amorenge naende, na kararore ng’a oborwaire boria bwatubire omobere bwonsi bw’omonto oria, rirorio ateebe ng’a ochenekire. Onye omobere bwonsi obeire omorabu, omonto oria obeire oyochenegete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye enyama embariri yachakire gokina imeo, omonto oyio tachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Omokuani ararore ng’a enyama eria embariri yasokire, rirorio ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti. Enyama eria embariri nigo ere eyetachenegeti. Obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye enyama eria embariri ekoonchoka ebe endabu, erio omonto oyio agende ase Omokuani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ere amorenge buya, na onye egesambo kiaonchokire na koraba, erio Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto onye orenge ne rigumba ase risankwa riaye, ne rigumba erio koriagwenire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na aase agwo, ase risankwa riareenge obobimbu oborabu bororekane, gose egesambo gekororekana kere nobobariri na oborabu, omonto oria goika agende ase Omokuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere amorenge buya, na kararore ng’a egesambo keria giakorire engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, na amarionya areo aonchokire na koraba, Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oria tachenegeti. Obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma bwaorokeire ase rigumba riria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omokuani karamorenge na arore ng’a amarionya ’egesambo keria tari amarabu, na tigekoreti engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, naende giachakire gosira, Omokuani abeeke omonto oria ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye oborwaire obwo bwesiareire ase risankwa, erio Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti, risankwa rianyorire oborwaire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye egesambo keria tikeonchogeti na gwesiarera, eyio engoro ase rigumba riariete, na Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oria ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omonto ore ne risambo ri’omorero ayiete ase risankwa ri’omobere oye, na enyama embariri ekineteo ebe egesambo ki’obobariri na oborabu, gose kebe ekerabu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani areenge egesambo ekio. Onye amarionya egesambo ekio aonchokire na koraba, naende egesambo kiabeire engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa ri’omobere oye, obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma bwasokire ase risambo ri’omorero riareenge. Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti. Obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omokuani karaarenge egesambo keria, na arore ng’a amarionya aria areo taonchogeti abe amarabu, naende egesambo tikerakora engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, korende giachakire gosira, erio Omokuani amobeeke ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria gatano na kabere Omokuani amorenge naende. Kararore ng’a egesambo keria giesiareire ase risankwa, erio ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti. Obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye egesambo keria tikeonchogeti gose giesiarere ase risankwa, korende giachakire gosira, okwo nokobimba kwe risambo, na Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio ochenekire. Eyio engoro ye risankwa ri’omobere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omonto, omosacha gose omokungu, obwate egesambo ase omotwe oye, gose ase ekenyonyobu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani areenge egesambo ekio. Onye gekorete engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, naende onye amarionya areo are monuri na konyererea, erio Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti. Erio nerichoncho ri’oborwaire bwa ukoma ase omotwe oye, gose ase ekenyonyobu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani karaarenge richoncho riria na arore ng’a tirikoreti engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, naende amarionya amamwamu tari aroro, erio Omokuani amobeeke ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere Omokuani areenge naende oborwaire boria, na onye tibwesiarereti, naende amarionya amonuri tario, naende richoncho tirikoreti engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omonto oyio akigite etukia, korende takigita ase richoncho rire, na Omokuani amwatanane, amobeeke ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko ande atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere Omokuani amorenge naende, na onye richoncho riria tiriesiarereti ase risankwa, na tirikoreti engoro gochia ime goetania risankwa, Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio ochenekire, ase igo asibie chianga chiaye, abe oyochenegete kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye richoncho riria riesiareire ase risankwa magega gachenekire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani amorenge naende, na kararore ng’a richoncho riria riesiareire, takorigia korora gose amarionya are monuri nareo, omonto oyio tachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani kararore ng’a richoncho riria tirionchogeti, na amarionya amamwamu amerire imeo, richoncho riria riagwenire, na omonto oria ochenekire kegima. Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omosacha gose omokungu obwate ebisambo ebirabu ase risankwa ri’omobere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani amorenge. Nere kararore ng’a ebisambo bie risankwa ri’omobere nigo bire ebirabu ake, ebisambo ebio tibiri bobe; omonto oyio ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye omonto osunyokire etukia, risio riachiire magega, nigo are nyaisio, ere ochenekire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na onye osunyokire etukia y’omotwe bosio, boigo ere ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye ase risio ri’omotwe oye, magega gose bosio, obwate egesambo kere nobobariri na oborabu, obwo noborwaire bwa ukoma bwasokeire ase risio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, Omokuani karamorenge arore ng’a egesambo kebimbete ase risio riria, magega gose bosio, kere nobobariri na oborabu, na nigo gekororekana buna oborwaire bwa ukoma mbore ase risankwa ri’omobere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omonto oyio nabwate oborwaire bwa ukoma, ere tachenegeti. Omokuani ateebe ng’a omonto oyio tachenegeti; oborwaire nigo bore ase omotwe oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto obwate oborwaire bwa ukoma abeeke chianga amachanchabe, tabaisa gochanua etukia yaye, atube omonwa oye ase egekoba kia igoro, erio aake eriogi na gokuura: Inche tinchenegeti! Tinchenegeti!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agenderere koba oyotachenegeti ekero are noborwaire boria, aatananwe amenye isiko y’egetwori, ao korwa ase abanto bande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ukoma ase chianga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye ukoma bore ase eanga eroisirie korwa ase amarionya gose egatani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose bore ase egetambaa keroisirie ase chingencho ao ao korwa ase egatani, gose ase amarionya, gose ase rirondia rie risankwa, gose ase egento kende gionsi keroisirie korwa ase risankwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na onye ekemoa gekororekana kere nekieni buna obonyansi, gose ekebariri, ase eanga, gose ase risankwa, gose ase egetambaa keria, gose ase egento kende keroisirie korwa ase risankwa, obwo noukoma bogwesiarera, na ebinto ebi biorokigwe ase Omokuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani areenge egento kere na ukoma, erio akebeke ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere Omokuani akerenge naende. Kararore ng’a ogosareka koria gwesiareire ase eanga, gose ase egetambaa keroisirie ase chingencho ao ao, gose ase risankwa, gose ase egento kende gionsi keroisirie korwa ase risankwa, nigo kiabwatetwe na ukoma obobe mono; egento ekio tigechenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo egento ekio gesambwe n’omorero, gokeraabe eanga, gose egetambaa kende gionsi, keroisirie korwa ase amarionya, gose korwa ase egatani, gose gento kende gionsi keroisirie korwa ase risankwa kere noborwaire obwo ime yaye. Obwo noborwaire obobe bwa ukoma; ebinto ebio goika bisambwe n’omorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omokuani karaarenge na arore ng’a ekemoa keria tigieseraarereti ase eanga eria, gose ase egetambaa keria, gose ase kende gionsi keroisirie korwa ase risankwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rirorio achike ng’a egento ekio giasarekire, tiga gesibigwe na kebekwe ase egesomo ase engaki y’amatuko ande atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani areenge ekemoa ase egento keria magega kogiasibigwe. Kararore ng’a ekemoa keria tikeraonchoka, egento keria tigechenegeti, nonya ekemoa ekio tigiesiarereti. Egento keria gesambwe n’omorero, ekiagera ekemoa keria negi’okoboosia, onye kere isiko gose ime ase egento ekio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye Omokuani okorenga egento ekio magega kogiasibigwe, na arore ng’a ekemoa keria ngosira kere, rirorio ataandore aase ekemoa keria kere, akerusie korwa ase eanga eria, gose risankwa, gose egetambaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye ekemoa gekororekana naende ase eanga eria, gose ase egetambaa keroisirie ase chingencho ao ao, gose ase gento kende gionsi keroisirie korwa ase risankwa, igo nekemoa gia ukoma kiaorokeire. Egento keria goika gesambwe n’omorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekemoa gokeranyorekane ng’a giasirire ekero eanga, gose egetambaa keria, gose gento kende gionsi keroisirie korwa ase risankwa, giasibigwe, rirorio gesibigwe eria kabere. Bono egento keria nakebe giachenekire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nakwo ogochika igoro ase ebinto bire na ukoma, kobiraabe chianga chiroisirie korwa ase amarionya gose egatani, gose gokeraabe egetambaa keroisirie ase chingencho ao ao, gose gento kende gionsi keroisirie korwa ase risankwa. Ase ogochika okwo egento ekio inagiatorwe ng’a giachenekire, gose tigechenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
